 and inspect every contact point before starting.","From hands and knees, reach opposite arm and leg long while the pelvis stays square.","Complete the final repetition with the same controlled range, then exit the position safely."],"cues":["Make a long line, not a high one.","Use a repeatable, pain-free range."],"mistakes":["Arching or rotating to lift farther.","Continuing after position, control, or equipment security is lost."],"cautionTags":["reported_wrist_knee_or_back_discomfort"],"reviewStatus":"reviewed","contentVersion":"1.0.0","license":"STHENO_ORIGINAL"},{"slug":"hollow-body-tuck-hold","name":"Tuck Hollow Hold","family":"anti_extension","pattern":"isolation","role":"accessory","primaryMuscles":["core"],"secondaryMuscles":[],"requiredEquipment":["bodyweight"],"skill":"beginner","fatigueCost":3,"setupMinutes":1,"repRange":[15,45],"progressionSuitability":3,"unilateral":false,"instructions":["Set up in a clear space and inspect every contact point before starting.","Lie on the back, tuck the knees, lift the shoulders slightly, and hold the low back gently down.","Complete the final repetition with the same controlled range, then exit the position safely."],"cues":["Shorten the lever to stay controlled.","Use a repeatable, pain-free range."],"mistakes":["Continuing after the low back arches.","Continuing after position, control, or equipment security is lost."],"cautionTags":["reported_neck_or_back_discomfort"],"reviewStatus":"reviewed","contentVersion":"1.0.0","license":"STHENO_ORIGINAL"},{"slug":"bodyweight-mountain-climber-slow","name":"Slow Mountain Climber","family":"anti_extension","pattern":"isolation","role":"accessory","primaryMuscles":["core"],"secondaryMuscles":["shoulders","quadriceps"],"requiredEquipment":["bodyweight"],"skill":"beginner","fatigueCost":3,"setupMinutes":1,"repRange":[10,30],"progressionSuitability":3,"unilateral":true,"instructions":["Set up in a clear space and inspect every contact point before starting.","From a high plank, b